Skinned, textured quadruped rigged and animated in Meshy (27-bone skeleton with a single
baked "Armature|Unreal Take|baselayer" walk clip). Owned by the project per Meshy premium
terms. Original Cubicraftia asset — first skinned-GLB animated creature (giraffe walk).
